    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d342-a2">

                <pb facs="0602" n="540" sameAs="frus:frus1878/pg540"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 660.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr.
                            Vallarta.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Unofficial.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1878-01-10"><hi rendition="#italic">January</hi> 10,
                        1878</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    to-day of your excellency’s verbal note of the 7th instant, relating to the Rio
                    Grande City jail assailants, and to state that I will forward a copy thereof to
                    my government for its information.</p>
                <p>I improve this opportunity to reiterate to your excellency the assurances of my
                    distinguished esteem.</p>
                <closer><signed>JOHN W. FOSTER.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
